e=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(247, 249, 3);box-sizing: border-box;\">同时给大家送个<span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">【T字战法】的指标福利</strong></span>，这个指标选股、做T都很好用，大家可以<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">扫描下方二维码，进群领取下</strong>。</span></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMMzHx7sqN33p6JG7jjoc8HVjvENN8VpeZlmRA8RAPibIlHdR21WFMjibswjsFVbWYnfu2CZKZJF0l3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1920\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"text-align: justify;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">在此声明：</strong>不收任何费用，只做交流学习用，有兴趣的可以进去交流下，有私下荐股收费等直接拉黑。<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(15, 15, 15);box-sizing: border-box;\">感谢朋友们的关注，阅读最后<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">点赞和点在看</strong></span>，并把公众号<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">设置为星标</strong></span>，留下你来过的痕迹。如果没有经常阅读，或者<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;box-s